-- ============================================================
--  ORDERS  (DIURNAL profile — real morning/midday peaks per park)
--
--  COMPLETED  (Apr 1 – Jun 20 2026)  : 3223 rows  — past visits, entry+exit set
--  CONFIRMED  (Jun 21 – Jul 31 2026) : 1617 rows  — future bookings, no entry
--  CANCELLED  (scattered Apr–Jul)    : 34 rows
--  NO_SHOW    (scattered past dates) : 14 rows
--
--  Each (park,date) concentrates its daily volume around the park's peak hour
--  (Yosemite ~10:00, Grand Canyon ~12:00, Yellowstone ~13:00) with a per-day
--  jittered centre, so the Usage Report (avg visitors per operating day, by
--  hour) shows a clear peak/valley curve while day totals still vary
--  weekend-vs-weekday for the Visit Report.
--
--  NOTE: the Usage Report query divides each hour's monthly visitor total by a
--  CONSTANT per-park operating-day count (not per-hour active days), so rarely
--  used early/late hours correctly read low instead of being averaged up.
--
--  FIXED showcase: Yosemite 2026-07-03 = exactly 86 confirmed @ 10:00.
--  Generator-enforced: size 1–15; individual=1; every group led by an approved
--  guide; no visitor double-booked at same park/date/time; all FKs valid.
-- ============================================================

